    "   \"metadata\": {},\n",
    "   \"source\": [\n",
    "    \"---\\n\",\n",
    "    \"**Notes**\\n\",\n",
    "    \"- `if/elif/else`: first true branch executes; `else` binds to the nearest unmatched `if`.\\n\",\n",
    "    \"- `while True` without `break` never terminates.\\n\",\n",
    "    \"- `continue` skips to the next iteration; `break` exits the loop.\\n\",\n",
    "    \"- `enumerate(iterable, start=1)` yields `(index, item)`.\\n\",\n",
    "    \"- `range(start, stop, step)`: `stop` is **exclusive**.\"\n",
    "   ]\n",
    "  }\n",
